## How to Use This Repository

### For New Team Members

1. Start with this README (you're reading it!)
2. Review the Executive Summary section
3. Read `DOC_02_TFB_Data_Quality_Analyst_JD.pdf` to understand the role
4. Complete the "Quick-Start Guide" section using sample data
5. Review sample SQL queries to understand implementation patterns

### For SQL Query Development

1. Review the relevant query in `03_Validation_and_Profiling_SQL/` or `04_Root_Cause_Analysis_SQL/`
2. Understand the expected input (CSV files) and output
3. Modify query for your specific use case
4. Test in development environment before deploying to production

### For Dashboard/BI Development

1. Review the KPI definitions in the "Data Quality Scorecard" section
2. Execute `SQL_09_Final_DQ_Scorecard_Metrics.sql` to understand available metrics
3. Connect Power BI / Tableau to `06_Data_Quality_Scorecard/CSV_06_Scorecard_Results_Export.csv`
4. Build visualizations for executive stakeholders

### For Compliance Reporting

1. Verify all HB 2067 requirements are met (Section: "Statutory Mandate")
2. Execute HB 2067 compliance check (`SQL_01`)
3. Generate report from golden layer view (`vw_pc_policyperiod_cleansed`)
4. Prepare audit trail documentation from remediation logs

