# Comprehensive Data Dictionary
## TFB Underwriting Data Quality Lifecycle & HB 2067 Compliance

**Document Owner:** Data Governance Committee  
**Author:** Daniel Rodriguez III, Data Quality Analyst II  
**Date:** April 18, 2026  
Column Name: [Name as it appears in the system] Data Type: [SQL Server/BigQuery data type] Length/Precision: [Maximum length or numeric precision] Nullable: [YES/NO] Primary Key: [YES/NO] Foreign Key: [Referenced table.column if applicable] Business Definition: [Plain-English meaning and business context] Technical Description: [Implementation details, transformations applied] Validation Rules: [Constraints, acceptable values, formats] Quality Rule ID: [Links to SOP 3 Validation Rule Execution] Data Owner: [Responsible stakeholder] Sample Values: [Example of valid data] Known Issues: [Current data quality problems affecting this field] HB 2067 Applicability: [YES/NO – indicates if field affects statutory compliance] TDI Mapping: [Links to TDI regulatory requirements if applicable] Lineage: [Source system → Staging → Cleansed layer]

