### Data Type Conventions

| Data Type | Range/Format | Notes |
|-----------|---|---|
| **STRING/VARCHAR** | Up to 255 characters | Text fields; case-sensitive in BigQuery |
| **BIGINT/INT64** | -9,223,372,036,854,775,808 to 9,223,372,036,854,775,807 | Integer values |
| **FLOAT64/DECIMAL** | Floating-point precision | Monetary values should use DECIMAL(10,2) |
| **DATE** | YYYY-MM-DD format | No time component |
| **TIMESTAMP** | YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS UTC | Includes time and timezone |
| **BOOLEAN** | TRUE/FALSE | Stored as 1/0 in SQL Server |

