Severity
Code
Column Name:              Severity
Data Type:                STRING(20)
Length:                   20 characters
Nullable:                 NO
Business Definition:      Priority classification of the issue based on business impact. 
                         Drives escalation protocol and response time requirements.
Technical Description:    Enumerated values:
                         - 'CRITICAL' = Halts underwriting or breaches TDI SLA (1–4 hour response)
                         - 'HIGH' = Affects pricing/risk assessment (24-hour response)
                         - 'WARNING' = Reporting inaccuracy or cosmetic issue (best-effort)
