Data Quality Scorecard Schema
Data Quality Metrics (SQL_09_Final_DQ_Scorecard_Metrics.sql Output)
The scorecard quantifies data health across six dimensions per DAMA-DMBOK standards:

Dimension	Metric	Formula	Target	Current	Gap
Accuracy	% Records Passing Validation Rules	(Valid Records / Total Records) × 100	99.0%	93.43%	-5.57%
Completeness	Fill Rate for Mandatory Fields	(Non-NULL Fields / Total Fields) × 100	100.0%	97.85%	-2.15%
Consistency	Cross-System Alignment Rate	(Aligned Records / Total Records) × 100	100.0%	59.20%	-40.80%
Timeliness	Data Load Lag (hours)	CURRENT_TIME - Load_End_Time	< 4 hrs	2.5 hrs	✓ PASS
Validity	Code Conformance Rate	(Valid Codes / Total Codes) × 100	100.0%	94.71%	-5.29%
Integrity	Orphan Record Count	Count(*) WHERE parent = NULL	0	20	-20 records
Data Lineage & Transformation Mappings
End-to-End Data Flow
Code
SOURCE SYSTEMS (Real-time)
├─ Guidewire PolicyCenter (Olos Release)
│  └─ pc_policyperiod, pc_policylocation, pc_vehicle
├─ Guidewire BillingCenter
│  └─ bc_policy
└─ Texas Department of Insurance Reference
   └─ TDI_Reason_Mapping

                    ↓ [INFORMATICA CDI STREAMING]

STAGING LAYER (BigQuery)
├─ raw_underwriting_data.pc_policyperiod
├─ raw_underwriting_data.pc_policylocation
├─ raw_underwriting_data.pc_vehicle
├─ raw_underwriting_data.bc_policy
└─ raw_underwriting_data.TDI_Reason_Mapping

                    ↓ [SQL PROFILING QUERIES: SQL_01–04]

VALIDATION & PROFILING LAYER
├─ SQL_01: HB2067_Compliance_Check
├─ SQL_02: Referential_Integrity_Check
├─ SQL_03: Data_Standards_VIN_Check
└─ SQL_04: Geocoding_Completeness_Check

                    ↓ [RCA QUERIES: SQL_05–08]

ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS LAYER
├─ SQL_05: RCA_HB2067_Temporal_Spread
├─ SQL_06: RCA_Orphan_Trace
├─ SQL_07: RCA_Catastrophe_Geo_Cluster
└─ SQL_08: RCA_Financial_Premium_Drift

                    ↓ [REMEDIATION & CLEANSING: DDL_01–04]

