└─ Real-time alerting & escalation

                    ↓ [KPI CALCULATION: SQL_09]

DATA QUALITY SCORECARD
├─ Accuracy, Completeness, Consistency, Timeliness, Validity, Integrity
└─ Executive dashboard & reporting

                    ↓

EXTERNAL DELIVERABLES
├─ TDI Monthly/Quarterly Statistical Reports (HB 2067)
├─ Executive scorecards
└─ Audit trail records
Retention Policies & Compliance
Data Retention Schedule
Dataset	Retention Period	Rationale	Compliance Requirement
Raw Layer (Staging)	90 days	Enables problem-root cause analysis; supports reprocessing	GDPR/DORA: 6 months for financial data
Cleansed Views	7 years	Statutory audit trail for HB 2067; TDI record retention	Texas Insurance Code §2703
Automated Issues Log	3 years	Issue trending, SLA compliance documentation	Internal policy; audit requirement
Data Dictionary (Versioned)	Indefinite	Metadata governance; audit trail of schema changes	DAMA-DMBOK standard practice
Backup Snapshots	90 days	Disaster recovery; corruption remediation	Business continuity policy
GDPR/DORA Compliance
Record of Processing Activities (RoPA):

Data Categories: Policy underwriting data, VIN numbers, geographic coordinates
Processing Purpose: Insurance underwriting, rate-setting, HB 2067 statutory compliance
Data Controllers: Texas Farm Bureau Casualty Insurance Company
Retention: 7 years (Policyholder may request deletion per GDPR rights)
