# Validation Rules Registry
## Core Business Logic for Data Quality Enforcement

**Document Owner:** Data Governance Committee  
**Author:** Daniel Rodriguez III, Data Quality Analyst II  
**Date:** April 18, 2026  
Rule ID: [VR-XXX-000] (Validation Rule ID) Rule Name: [Plain-English name] Category: [Mandatory Fields | Value Constraints | Format Standards | Referential Integrity | Logical Checks] Priority Level: [CRITICAL | HIGH | MEDIUM] Description: [Business purpose and impact]

