### VR-002-003: TDI Reason Code Existence (Reference Lookup)

Rule ID: VR-002-003 Rule Name: TDI Reason Code Mapping Validation Category: Value Constraints Priority Level: CRITICAL SOP Reference: SOP 3.1 Description: Validates cancellation reason codes map to TDI statutory codeset (A–X). Critical for HB 2067 reporting accuracy.

SOURCE TABLE(S):

pc_policyperiod (primary)
TDI_Reason_Mapping (reference)
TARGET RECORD(S):

Canceled, NonRenewed, Declined policies
Estimated volume (sample): 142 records
