### VR-004-001: Orphan Location Detection (Referential Integrity)

Rule ID: VR-004-001 Rule Name: Orphan Location Detection (Missing Parent Policy) Category: Referential Integrity Priority Level: CRITICAL SOP Reference: SOP 3.3 Description: Detects location records lacking parent policy reference. Orphaned records indicate system errors or batch processing failures.

SOURCE TABLE(S):

pc_policylocation (primary)
pc_policyperiod (parent reference)
