- VR-002-002: Date logic validation
- Execution: Real-time at policy binding

**BigQuery Scheduled Queries:**
- All profiling & RCA queries
- Execution: Per SOP 3 schedule
- Retention: 90 days (raw); 7 years (cleansed)

